    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Dark Quest 4?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Quest 4 is a turn based dungeon crawler where you create a party of 3 heroes and go on epic quests.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign with hand made quests with over 20 hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer up to 3 people</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn based combat and movement system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level editor to make stand alone quests or a campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop integration to share your creations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated figurines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique art world that looks, feels and plays like a tabletop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice over for the sorcerer playing the role of the Dungeon Master</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/3a5472eb5c1758a4a08b6fad0c9f4f68.poster.avif?t=1755047738\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/3a5472eb5c1758a4a08b6fad0c9f4f68.webm?t=1755047738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/3a5472eb5c1758a4a08b6fad0c9f4f68.mp4?t=1755047738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspirations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is heavily inspired by dungeon crawler board games such as Hero Quest, Descent 2nd edition, Dungeon Saga and others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Quest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its a game of your imagination!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Dark Quest 4?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Quest 4 is a turn based dungeon crawler where you create a party of 3 heroes and go on epic quests.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign with hand made quests with over 20 hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer up to 3 people</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn based combat and movement system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level editor to make stand alone quests or a campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop integration to share your creations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated figurines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique art world that looks, feels and plays like a tabletop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice over for the sorcerer playing the role of the Dungeon Master</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/3a5472eb5c1758a4a08b6fad0c9f4f68.poster.avif?t=1755047738\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/3a5472eb5c1758a4a08b6fad0c9f4f68.webm?t=1755047738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/3a5472eb5c1758a4a08b6fad0c9f4f68.mp4?t=1755047738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspirations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is heavily inspired by dungeon crawler board games such as Hero Quest, Descent 2nd edition, Dungeon Saga and others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Quest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its a game of your imagination!</p>",
